rty terminates it by written notice, and Recipient's obligations shall continue for a reasonable period thereafter."},{"term_key":"governing_law","value":"Laws of the State of New York","page_number":3,"confidence":0.97,"source_sentence":"This Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York."},{"term_key":"jurisdiction","value":"Exclusive jurisdiction of the state or federal courts in New York County, New York","page_number":3,"confidence":0.94,"source_sentence":"Any action arising out of this Agreement shall be brought exclusively in the state or federal courts located in New York County, New York."},{"term_key":"ip_ownership","value":null,"page_number":null,"confidence":0.15,"source_sentence":null},{"term_key":"non_solicitation","value":"Recipient may not solicit for employment any Discloser employee it dealt with on the proposal, for 12 months after the Effective Date.","page_number":2,"confidence":0.93,"source_sentence":"For twelve (12) months after the Effective Date, Recipient shall not solicit for employment any employee of Discloser with whom Recipient had contact in connection with the proposal."},{"term_key":"breach_remedy","value":"Discloser is entitled to equitable relief, including an injunction, without posting a bond.","page_number":2,"confidence":0.9,"source_sentence":"Any breach of this Agreement will cause irreparable harm, and Discloser shall be entitled to equitable relief, including an injunction, without posting a bond."}]}",
